{"parse":{"title":"铃兰之剑：八月日历","pageid":3049,"revid":6580,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AB%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A5%E5%8E%86&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AB%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A5%E5%8E%86&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AB%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A5%E5%8E%86&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF\" title=\"官方消息\">官方消息</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98\" title=\"专题\">专题</a> &gt; <b>铃兰之剑：八月日历</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E9.93.83.E5.85.B0.E4.B9.8B.E5.89.91.7C.E5.85.AB.E6.9C.88.E6.97.A5.E5.8E.86\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"铃兰之剑|八月日历\">铃兰之剑|八月日历</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%AB%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A5%E5%8E%86&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：铃兰之剑|八月日历\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：小场记有版号啦！<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-07-31 18:07<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FDBSqqd4Q_iRgrYd5XNxJAw\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DBSqqd4Q_iRgrYd5XNxJAw</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<center><img alt=\"官方消息152.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/74/3pqssoupxpa38uv8m0ftpp3gzhyxz1b.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF152.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"90\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/74/3pqssoupxpa38uv8m0ftpp3gzhyxz1b.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" /></center>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; margin: 15px 0%; display: flex; flex-flow: row nowrap; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: auto; margin-right: -40px; flex: 10 10 0%; align-self: flex-start; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-right: 0%; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0%; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"border-top: 1px dashed rgb(158, 85, 31); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: auto; flex: 10 10 0%; align-self: flex-start; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-right: 0%; margin-left: 0%; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"border-top: 1px dashed rgb(158, 85, 31); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p>团长们好呀(oﾟ▽ﾟ)o\n<br /><br />\n大姐头最近在花园里养了好多猫猫ヾ(=^▽^=)ノ<br />\n在等待团长回家的日子里，乐土都快要变成猫猫乐园啦！<br />\n为团长送上乐土花园8月日历~❤ <br />\n放心放心，我们会把乐土打扫干净，等待团长回家！<br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; margin: 15px 0%; display: flex; flex-flow: row nowrap; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: auto; margin-right: -40px; flex: 10 10 0%; align-self: flex-start; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-right: 0%; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0%; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"border-top: 1px dashed rgb(158, 85, 31); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: auto; flex: 10 10 0%; align-self: flex-start; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-right: 0%; margin-left: 0%; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"border-top: 1px dashed rgb(158, 85, 31); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n<center><img alt=\"官方消息153.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/17/36cxyda3dnwnmo88oxilvw50vrfihyo.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF153.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"996\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/17/36cxyda3dnwnmo88oxilvw50vrfihyo.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF153.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/17/36cxyda3dnwnmo88oxilvw50vrfihyo.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1920\" /><br /><br /><img alt=\"官方消息154.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/57/bfhkazwr6widabzo576i392tlvboyp5.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF154.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/57/bfhkazwr6widabzo576i392tlvboyp5.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF154.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/57/bfhkazwr6widabzo576i392tlvboyp5.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"608\" /></center>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; margin: 15px 0%; display: flex; flex-flow: row nowrap; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: auto; margin-right: -40px; flex: 10 10 0%; align-self: flex-start; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-right: 0%; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0%; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"border-top: 1px dashed rgb(1